* When user logs in the mobile app should call: {{/profile/verification/confirm/v3}}  with {{distinct_id}} *A*
* User logs out
* User logs in again, but this time mobile app should call: {{/profile/verification/confirm/v3}}  with {{distinct_id}} *B*

The same applies for 2 other endpoints (they are used when user logs in with social account or when user creates new account).

